      "writtenOn": "2023-06-15T19:37:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is true that we only print when initial factory mode is enabled, but the RMA centers need to know if factory is enable or not to determine which flow.\n\nIf we only print for `Yes`, then `No` and `Unknown` (which could be Yes) are indistinguishable.\n\nWe can wait and hear more feedback on b:286998283 about the machine format they are looking for. Maybe we don\u0027t even need to print anything in the format.",
